{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_027_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:13c83e2760bd2fd0f5c8bfd1c1f283bcc8e7298975ef132d665915093cdcd4e1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49a60b44752998be455a9f84333fd7e346ec4539ac0279064b717c47a67acece",
      "text": "观汝之神色……\n似乎是心生妙计了啊，卷绪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5779d3c7d16a7ea37bebca9bae74528bf3d749df2c184e9dc8a2fa98e75f7d3",
      "text": "是的！稍后再告诉大家。\n毕竟难得泡好的红茶都要凉了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13493238a211ca236f7eb2b1b04ad1abebbccebb0c8628beb1ccb31224eec03e",
      "text": "神谷先生，请好好期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:604eed8262e6a4b73db7c86d054ead5d8adbeb41ef95794b352cbeb90ef79a21",
      "text": "呵呵，我很期待哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dbab54f72377d6648642fcae13ad9259978b748afddbd6bd262df4bfc418aff",
      "text": "那么，开始东云的新款蛋糕和\n红茶搭配的品鉴会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000121:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4aef5e7f8178cae14406e0d432d5c51048c780537ed16ebd3400aad996cd261",
      "text": "多谢款待！每一款都是充分发挥了双方优点的绝妙搭配！真不愧是神谷先生和庄一郎先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97cbd0fd46b453050816af376e708169dca24032a8fef95e6e92ae5f4b86d42",
      "text": "每一款都好好吃～。\n不管推出哪一种，客人们肯定都会超开心的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:265774db1ccb7996fe1b29c4a3ca358ce9ed06edeb8b2fd94a9cfdcddee2789d",
      "text": "唔姆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000151:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c39f0fb1477874d111201442666621897b77fd67427fdbbff1d01bac371376f",
      "text": "那么，我们一边收拾，\n一边召开秘密作战会议吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000164:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f60789e9087cff722817a9a8d362c6154b083ff842431068c5ccef40e3c99825",
      "text": "神谷在此，\n好生委身于片刻的安宁便可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000171:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e99ae38e7b384644a3c7d8207e88a10e5443af7c51fb1b04f3aeb6dc166613",
      "text": "啪噼地好好期待着吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000183:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df44150d69bd6ac3ff32d5099ac5aaaece3bd55fabb0d8e21be9432c61ebd4da",
      "text": "好的，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_027yuk_02_1_2_027_02:1_2_027_02_b:cmd-000193:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8822c01990a315540ce6abd6d2dd92b09840fbacd26fb7c6a0167bc4f17970d",
      "text": "光是大家“为了我”这份心意，\n不管是什么样的派对我都已经很高兴了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
